   "summary": "This document presents a statistical survey and directory of educational institutions in Hokkaido Prefecture prepared by the Civil Information and Education Section in cooperation with the Japanese Ministry of Education. It outlines the administrative classification of Japanese schools under national, prefectural, municipal, town, village, and private control jurisdictions. Detailed summary tables report the number of institutions, student enrollments by sex, and faculty counts as of April and November 1946 across higher, secondary, elementary, and special education levels. An extensive roster lists individual institutions throughout Hokkaido, recording each school's address, founding date, enrollment figures, and teaching staff.",
   "title": "Educational Institutions in Japan: Hokkaido Prefecture (Summary Tables and Roster)",
